bbcode_enabled = true
bbcode_text = "[center][b]Hi everyone, 
We are back with some more adjustments
and a new BGM track!
Have fun :)

- Doro and Mario
[/b][/center]

o Added a BGM track that plays when you are on your last heart.

[b]Balancing[/b]
[center][b]Neutral[/b][/center]
o Holdall: Can now also be crafted using Hammer (without consuming it)
o Box of Prosperity: Can now also be crafted using Hammer
   (without consuming it)
o Boiling Pot: Speed bonus 15% -> 30%
o Stone Armor: Block 110 -> 120
o Frostbite: Vampirism 10 -> 12
o Spin to Win: Cooldown 3.5s -> 3.6s
o King of the Bling: Restock chance 70% -> 75%
o Seal the Deal: Cooldown 5s -> 5.2s
o Speak with Animals: Sale chance 20% -> 25%
o Investment Opportunity: Maximum health 6 -> 7
o Smithing for Dummies: Stamina cost -30% -> -35%
o Knife to Meet You: Speed per dagger 50% -> 60%
o Power of the Moon: Fatigue timing -5s -> -6s
o Blood Manipulation: Speed per vampiric item 25% -> 30%
o Girl Power: Speed per class item 30% -> 35%
o Fortuna’s Kiss: Chance bonus 33% -> 35%
o Hardwood: Damage bonus 150% -> 165%
o Enchanted Weapons: Repeat chance 22% -> 25%
o Echoing Battlecry: Speed bonus 60% -> 65%

[center][b]Multiclass[/b][/center]
o Ice Dragon: Block 80 -> 90
o Hogus Bogus: Stamina maximum 5 -> 6, buffs per stamina 5 -> 4

[center][b]Ranger[/b][/center]
o Critwood Staff: Crit buff duration 1.4s -> 1.5s

[center][b]Reaper[/b][/center]
o Frog Prince: Cooldown 2.9s -> 2.6s
o Relic Case: Cooldown 2.6s -> 2.5s
o Dark Ritual: Speed per darkness item 20% -> 25%

[center][b]Pyromancer[/b][/center]
o Dragon Nest: Mana 4 -> 6
o Enraged Phoenix: Crit chance per fire item 5% -> 6%

[center][b]Berserker[/b][/center]
o Shaman Mask: Cooldown 3.4s -> 3.6s
o Dragon Set: Cooldown 0.8s -> 0.7

[center][b]Adventurer[/b][/center]
o Fedora: Cooldown 2.3s -> 2.5s

[center][b]Engineer[/b][/center]
o Electric Torch: Blind 7 -> 8
o Lightning Staff: Stamina cost 1 -> 0.7
o Chainsaw: Stamina cost 1 -> 0.7
o Spring Loader: Cooldown 8s -> 7.5s
o Eat-o-matic: Other food bonus 60% -> 65%
o Bismuth Cube: Maximum uses 15 -> 12"
text = "Hi everyone, 
We are back with some more adjustments
and a new BGM track!
Have fun :)

- Doro and Mario


o Added a BGM track that plays when you are on your last heart.

Balancing
Neutral
o Holdall: Can now also be crafted using Hammer (without consuming it)
o Box of Prosperity: Can now also be crafted using Hammer
   (without consuming it)
o Boiling Pot: Speed bonus 15% -> 30%
o Stone Armor: Block 110 -> 120
o Frostbite: Vampirism 10 -> 12
o Spin to Win: Cooldown 3.5s -> 3.6s
