o Blood Manipulation: Speed per vampiric item 25% -> 30%
o Girl Power: Speed per class item 30% -> 35%
o Fortuna’s Kiss: Chance bonus 33% -> 35%
o Hardwood: Damage bonus 150% -> 165%
o Enchanted Weapons: Repeat chance 22% -> 25%
o Echoing Battlecry: Speed bonus 60% -> 65%

Multiclass
o Ice Dragon: Block 80 -> 90
o Hogus Bogus: Stamina maximum 5 -> 6, buffs per stamina 5 -> 4

Ranger
o Critwood Staff: Crit buff duration 1.4s -> 1.5s

Reaper
o Frog Prince: Cooldown 2.9s -> 2.6s
o Relic Case: Cooldown 2.6s -> 2.5s
o Dark Ritual: Speed per darkness item 20% -> 25%

Pyromancer
o Dragon Nest: Mana 4 -> 6
o Enraged Phoenix: Crit chance per fire item 5% -> 6%

Berserker
